---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Meet Neil Johnson — wedding, corporate event, conference, and headshot photographer serving Los Angeles County and Orange County."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-24">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-5xl">About Neil</h1>

    {
      /* TODO(Neil): Replace with your real bio copy from the live site —
         this is placeholder text based on the site's general tone, not a verbatim copy. */
    }
    <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-stone">
      <p>
        I'm Neil Johnson, a wedding, corporate event, conference, and headshot photographer based
        in Los Angeles County, serving clients throughout LA and Orange County.
      </p>
      <p>
        I strive to capture every moment with a blend of creativity and precision — from
        candid, unscripted emotion on a wedding day to polished, professional headshots for
        your business. My goal is always the same: authentic images you'll want to look back on
        for years to come.
      </p>
      <p>
        Whether you're planning a wedding at a winery, a corporate conference, or need updated
        headshots for your team, I'd love to hear about your event.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a
      href="/contact"
      class="mt-8 inline-block bg-ink px-6 py-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-accent"
    >
      Get In Touch
    </a>
  </section>
